00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:19.319
I need to get the fuck outta
here before this tricks me.

00:21:19.319 --> 00:21:20.152
- Yeah.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:25.778
- So basically after that,
there was nothing going on.

00:21:25.778 --> 00:21:27.228
- Right, right yeah.

00:21:27.228 --> 00:21:28.061
- I was working through
happy hour every day.

00:21:28.061 --> 00:21:30.380
