just movin' back, right.

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:41.610
So I sold my shares and
said no, this is not for me.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:43.010
There's no more growth left.
- Yup.

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:44.230
