00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:53.460
Then one of my old buddies
I used to work with

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:54.400
was in real estate.

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:56.197
He yelled to me and said,
"Hey, I've got a great idea.

00:21:56.197 --> 00:21:57.287
