00:21:57.287 --> 00:21:59.960
"I've got all the way the
leads work and all that."

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.060
So I said, "Alright,
let's give it a shot."

00:22:01.060 --> 00:22:03.370
So we give it a shot and our leaving,

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:04.600
closing down the ad firm,

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:07.000
going full force into the real estate.

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.150
That (mumbles) of not working out.

00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:12.475
So ultimately just had
to pick up the pieces.

00:22:12.475 --> 00:22:16.070
We grew the brokerage
to about 40, 45 agents.

00:22:16.070 --> 00:22:19.254
But our overhead was 20, 25 grand a month.

00:22:19.254 --> 00:22:20.087
It was just killin' us.

00:22:20.087 --> 00:22:22.140
People were ordering
stupid office supplies.

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:23.394
It was retarded.

00:22:23.394 --> 00:22:24.227
It was like what are we doing?

00:22:24.227 --> 00:22:25.430
We need to clean house

00:22:25.430 --> 00:22:27.157
