00:22:27.157 --> 00:22:28.780
be a boutique shop.

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:30.820
So we did that over the years.

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:32.974
Ultimately now, we're about 14, 15 agents;

00:22:32.974 --> 00:22:34.963
