et cetera, et cetera.

00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:47.673
Then use all our knowledge
from the advertising world

00:22:47.673 --> 00:22:50.190
will apply to real
estate because the system

00:22:50.190 --> 00:22:51.465
was really broken I thought.

00:22:51.465 --> 00:22:55.990
95% of the agents in my
opinion are incompetent

00:22:55.990 --> 00:22:58.260
