00:23:18.840 --> 00:23:20.690
But it also helps them with training.

00:23:21.870 --> 00:23:22.990
- It's a SaaS business?

00:23:22.990 --> 00:23:24.256
- It is, yeah.

00:23:24.256 --> 00:23:25.110
So that's where I'm at now.
- Really cool.

00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:27.948
- So business is still going.
- Great.

00:23:27.948 --> 00:23:30.176
- I'm in the third stage of development

00:23:30.176 --> 00:23:32.383
with a--
- It's cool.

