00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:39.340
- [Brian] I wanna tell ya.

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:42.460
Brian again.
- What's up, Brian.

00:23:42.460 --> 00:23:44.983
- Yup we figured. (laughs)

00:23:46.850 --> 00:23:49.580
- I manage a real estate
office for (mumbles).

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:51.130
Program manager for about 60 agents,

00:23:51.130 --> 00:23:53.240
about 40 live ones

00:23:54.350 --> 00:23:56.120
