00:24:27.310 --> 00:24:28.143
I said, "What is that?"

00:24:28.143 --> 00:24:30.797
He goes, "Not for long section."

00:24:32.365 --> 00:24:34.497
He goes, "Let him know it
wasn't a group decision.

00:24:34.497 --> 00:24:36.920
"This was a mandate from
me," he said on a Sunday

00:24:36.920 --> 00:24:38.260
