00:24:38.260 --> 00:24:40.210
So you got a big fan.

00:24:40.210 --> 00:24:42.484
- I know that.
- Yeah.

00:24:42.484 --> 00:24:43.980
- I've been in business long enough

00:24:43.980 --> 00:24:45.560
to know how this stuff works.

00:24:45.560 --> 00:24:46.580
Yet there's sand.

00:24:46.580 --> 00:24:48.690
What I do for a living always

00:24:48.690 --> 00:24:52.257
is not what people on
defense want to hear.

00:24:52.257 --> 00:24:53.090
- Okay.

00:24:54.100 --> 00:24:55.697
- The most remarkable part of VaynerMedia

00:24:55.697 --> 00:24:58.210
and its success is I haven't
been selling anything

00:24:58.210 --> 00:24:59.193
anybody wants yet.

00:25:01.262 --> 00:25:02.870
(muffled conversation)

00:25:02.870 --> 00:25:04.730
This most remarkable
part of this company...

00:25:04.730 --> 00:25:06.097
You probably know this best coming from

00:25:06.097 --> 00:25:08.378
