00:25:08.378 --> 00:25:11.350
VaynerMedia is selling
to a group of people,

00:25:11.350 --> 00:25:14.303
biggest companies in the
world: Budweiser, Chase.

00:25:15.440 --> 00:25:19.121
Services and strategies that
nobody in upper management

00:25:19.121 --> 00:25:23.733
