00:25:42.027 --> 00:25:43.170
- And I believe that.

00:25:43.170 --> 00:25:44.210
- He made the decision.

00:25:44.210 --> 00:25:45.907
He said this wasn't and yeah.

00:25:45.907 --> 00:25:48.180
- And that's how things happen at Vayner.

00:25:48.180 --> 00:25:50.530
I let the team do tons of shit.

00:25:50.530 --> 00:25:51.633
I don't even know what's happenin'.

00:25:51.633 --> 00:25:52.670
It's a big company.
