- 100%.

00:26:12.350 --> 00:26:14.428
It's also just he's smart.

00:26:14.428 --> 00:26:16.280
I always say...

00:26:17.280 --> 00:26:19.500
My life has been super
interesting over the last 10 years

00:26:19.500 --> 00:26:22.300
