involved outside the customer.

00:26:22.300 --> 00:26:24.850
My life is basically about the customer.

00:26:24.850 --> 00:26:26.140
This is interesting with you.

00:26:26.140 --> 00:26:27.890
This is your business right now.

00:26:27.890 --> 00:26:30.970
The thought of being at the
mercy of a fuckin' plumber

00:26:30.970 --> 00:26:32.450
