00:27:28.350 --> 00:27:29.183
'cause that's your vulnerability.

00:27:29.183 --> 00:27:30.253
That's practical.

00:27:32.860 --> 00:27:37.050
I'm far more immigrant than
I am motivational speaker.

00:27:37.890 --> 00:27:41.330
If you really dissect me,
it's just about staying alive

00:27:41.330 --> 00:27:42.573
