if you're gonna do that,

00:27:46.690 --> 00:27:48.320
doin' it in a way where it's fun

00:27:48.320 --> 00:27:50.313
to wake up in the morning versus not.

00:27:54.140 --> 00:27:56.143
For example, a lot of our businesses,

00:27:57.350 --> 00:27:59.360
maybe they're not as scalable.

00:27:59.360 --> 00:28:00.680
But who gives a flip?

00:28:00.680 --> 00:28:03.060
To me, here's where it
gets to it's basic form.

00:28:03.060 --> 00:28:05.380
You know how many people can
build a six figure business?

00:28:05.380 --> 00:28:06.830
A lot less than people think.

00:28:09.970 --> 00:28:12.600
Actually you just made my day.

00:28:12.600 --> 00:28:13.433
Yeah you.

00:28:18.544 --> 00:28:19.730
Especially if you're under 25 right now,

00:28:19.730 --> 00:28:22.020
this notion that everybody has to...

00:28:22.020 --> 00:28:24.404
The fact that almost every
entrepreneur right now under 30

00:28:24.404 --> 00:28:27.340
thinks that a million
dollar revenue business

00:28:27.340 --> 00:28:28.913
