we're in there, right?

00:29:28.130 --> 00:29:31.423
The bottom of it is
400-something thousand a year.

00:29:33.230 --> 00:29:35.730
If you make 400,000 a year and up,

00:29:35.730 --> 00:29:39.453
you're in the 1%, the 1% of America.

00:29:40.530 --> 00:29:44.710
But the talk and the
branding of entrepreneurship

00:29:44.710 --> 00:29:47.830
