00:29:47.830 --> 00:29:50.110
It's so crazy.

00:29:50.110 --> 00:29:52.213
So I'm obsessed with practicality.

00:29:55.060 --> 00:29:56.143
That's what I like.

00:29:58.498 --> 00:30:00.583
