00:30:28.030 --> 00:30:29.950
Meaning we just do.

00:30:29.950 --> 00:30:32.303
Your true stories are what matters.

00:30:35.760 --> 00:30:37.660
Once you get to that place
where you're good with yourself

00:30:37.660 --> 00:30:38.932
