00:31:06.443 --> 00:31:07.276
utter bullshit.
- Garbage.

00:31:07.276 --> 00:31:08.558
It's real bad.

00:31:08.558 --> 00:31:09.480
You know what's really sad?

00:31:09.480 --> 00:31:13.310
Is that's 25 years ago
with the actualization

00:31:13.310 --> 00:31:16.053
