00:31:17.700 --> 00:31:21.060
Back to practicality, it
was already somewhat bad.

00:31:21.060 --> 00:31:24.540
It now makes absolutely,
positively no sense.

00:31:24.540 --> 00:31:25.373
We're making kids...

00:31:25.373 --> 00:31:28.971
85% of the kids in this country
are memorizing information.

00:31:28.971 --> 00:31:31.316
- But I think there's hope.
- I don't know

00:31:31.316 --> 00:31:32.379
what to tell you.

00:31:32.379 --> 00:31:37.170
- I'm gonna tell you what I
think the hope is and that is

00:31:37.170 --> 00:31:41.220
I selfishly as a 25 or 27 year old kid,

00:31:41.220 --> 00:31:44.450
not kid sorry, young person, at the time

00:31:44.450 --> 00:31:49.450
