anything close to I was...

01:39:23.860 --> 01:39:26.640
I would try to become the
biggest artist in the world.

01:39:26.640 --> 01:39:29.200
Because it would have been like, fuck.

01:39:29.200 --> 01:39:31.690
It's daunting 'cause I want my own path.

01:39:31.690 --> 01:39:32.533
That's who I am.

01:39:33.718 --> 01:39:35.230
With the same chemicals that I have,

01:39:35.230 --> 01:39:36.833
I would have wanted my own path.

01:39:39.780 --> 01:39:43.800
So look man, if it's that real,
sounds like it's super real.

01:39:43.800 --> 01:39:47.410
You need to try to figure
out what makes you tick

01:39:47.410 --> 01:39:52.410
and it's very cliched for
kids to have very opposite

01:39:52.560 --> 01:39:56.203
reactions to very
significant parent success.

01:39:57.913 --> 01:40:00.740
You either wanna go crazy
and build a fuckin' empire

01:40:02.060 --> 01:40:05.723
or you wanna go save the
world or give it all back.

01:40:07.190 --> 01:40:09.283
Not play the same score.

01:40:11.115 --> 01:40:12.725
- [Man] I think that
is what the problem is.

01:40:12.725 --> 01:40:15.035
I have zero self confidence right now.

01:40:15.035 --> 01:40:16.840
- I think you have a lot, bro.

01:40:16.840 --> 01:40:18.970
I think the fact that you're
even using the terminology...

01:40:18.970 --> 01:40:22.990
I think that you are early in the process.

01:40:22.990 --> 01:40:24.230
But I think that you even know what

01:40:24.230 --> 01:40:26.830
self-awareness is is
a good starting point.

01:40:26.830 --> 01:40:27.790
Lack of self-awareness is

01:40:27.790 --> 01:40:29.723
not even acknowledging its existence.

01:40:31.170 --> 01:40:33.543
You don't know yourself yet,

01:40:35.320 --> 01:40:36.603
but that makes sense.

01:40:38.350 --> 01:40:39.890
Most of us didn't.

01:40:39.890 --> 01:40:41.166
- [Man] So it's okay to not know

01:40:41.166 --> 01:40:43.200
what I'm going to do with my degree

01:40:43.200 --> 01:40:44.660
after a year of undergraduate?

01:40:44.660 --> 01:40:47.000
- 100% brother, it's preferable.

01:40:47.000 --> 01:40:50.540
- [Man] Can you like get hired by anyone?

01:40:50.540 --> 01:40:51.580
- Yeah.
- 'Til I figure out

01:40:51.580 --> 01:40:52.880
what's going on.
- 100%.

01:40:52.880 --> 01:40:55.550
My preference would be that
you get hired somewhere

01:40:55.550 --> 01:40:57.190
where it still gives you free time to get

01:40:57.190 --> 01:40:59.030
to know yourself too.

01:40:59.030 --> 01:41:00.120
You also have to understand
if you're doing it

01:41:00.120 --> 01:41:02.680
for yourself or if
you're doing it for them.

01:41:02.680 --> 01:41:04.040
If you're getting hired because you think

01:41:04.040 --> 01:41:05.920
that's what your parents want,

01:41:05.920 --> 01:41:07.940
you need to get to that place first.

01:41:07.940 --> 01:41:09.330
As long as your willing to live

01:41:09.330 --> 01:41:11.860
without them supporting you financially,

01:41:11.860 --> 01:41:13.560
well then you're off to the races.

01:41:15.190 --> 01:41:16.313
That's the leverage.

01:41:18.130 --> 01:41:21.717
- [Man] For me, my end
point is my family saying,

01:41:21.717 --> 01:41:23.770
"Yeah, we're proud of you."

01:41:23.770 --> 01:41:25.510
- I get it, it's very cultural

01:41:25.510 --> 01:41:30.510
for India and Russia and Asia.

01:41:30.790 --> 01:41:34.090
If you're brown, Asian
or Eastern European,

01:41:34.090 --> 01:41:37.000
we're all slight little
versions of the same shit.

01:41:37.000 --> 01:41:39.100
So I've always been very empathetic to it.

01:41:41.421 --> 01:41:43.223
Let me give you some really good advice.

01:41:44.460 --> 01:41:48.330
Making your parents proud on
their terms in the short term,

01:41:48.330 --> 01:41:51.056
often leads to a very bad
relationship in the long term

01:41:51.056 --> 01:41:52.603
and those years hurt.

01:41:53.920 --> 01:41:56.780
So a little pain in the beginning

01:41:56.780 --> 01:41:59.080
is a lot better than a
ton of pain at the end.

01:42:03.803 --> 01:42:06.350
It's easy to say when
you're not in it, like I am.

01:42:06.350 --> 01:42:08.260
But it's the truth.

01:42:08.260 --> 01:42:10.490
- [Man] It's especially
hard when me and my dad...

01:42:10.490 --> 01:42:12.315
He's the one supporting me and everything.

01:42:12.315 --> 01:42:13.653
I mean financially, the lot,

01:42:14.670 --> 01:42:15.690
like typical---

01:42:15.690 --> 01:42:17.263
- Old school, yeah I get it.

01:42:18.470 --> 01:42:20.270
You're communicating through your mom.

01:42:20.270 --> 01:42:21.257
- [Man] Exactly right.

01:42:21.257 --> 01:42:22.280
(group laughing)

01:42:22.280 --> 01:42:23.770
- I get it.
- How do you know?

01:42:23.770 --> 01:42:25.234
- I know because...

01:42:25.234 --> 01:42:27.060
The reason I'm good at this stuff

01:42:27.060 --> 01:42:30.620
is because there's only
18 to 44 things in life.

01:42:30.620 --> 01:42:31.583
Life's basic.

01:42:33.440 --> 01:42:34.273
I just know.

01:42:34.273 --> 01:42:35.770
I've also lived it.

01:42:35.770 --> 01:42:37.890
That's exactly what
happened with me and my dad.

01:42:37.890 --> 01:42:40.670
Luckily, I worked directly
for him and with him

01:42:40.670 --> 01:42:42.960
and over time we got there.

01:42:42.960 --> 01:42:44.360
But would have been my life.

01:42:45.447 --> 01:42:46.514
That is my brother's life.

01:42:46.514 --> 01:42:48.533
That is my sister's life.

01:42:49.650 --> 01:42:52.830
- [Man] So are you still close to him?

01:42:52.830 --> 01:42:53.663
- I'm very close to him,

01:42:53.663 --> 01:42:56.550
but what I did and what
I would recommend to you

01:42:56.550 --> 01:42:57.853
is to have the leverage.

01:43:00.653 --> 01:43:02.450
- [Man] So I actually go work for him?

01:43:02.450 --> 01:43:03.903
- My answer to leverage is

01:43:03.903 --> 01:43:07.973
not to be held accountable
to his finances.

01:43:10.570 --> 01:43:12.080
College is one thing.

01:43:12.080 --> 01:43:13.053
He wanted that.

01:43:14.120 --> 01:43:16.210
But the day you end

01:43:16.210 --> 01:43:18.223
is the day you don't take another dollar.

01:43:20.410 --> 01:43:22.330
It's 100% right, self-reliance.

01:43:22.330 --> 01:43:23.483
You can't allow it;

01:43:24.450 --> 01:43:26.300
otherwise the relationship is skewed.

01:43:28.060 --> 01:43:30.230
Let me promise you one thing.

01:43:30.230 --> 01:43:32.590
That is going to garner more respect

01:43:32.590 --> 01:43:34.040
than anything you'll ever do,

01:43:36.260 --> 01:43:39.340
especially if your dad
wants you to take it.

01:43:39.340 --> 01:43:42.000
Because the other thing
with old school dads

01:43:42.000 --> 01:43:42.833
is they want you to take it

01:43:42.833 --> 01:43:44.773
because they like using it as leverage.

01:43:45.850 --> 01:43:47.350
As long as you're taking it,

01:43:47.350 --> 01:43:49.250
then he can make you do what he wants.

01:43:52.350 --> 01:43:55.659
- [Man] He's not the kind
who's like do this, do that.

01:43:55.659 --> 01:43:56.492
- Good.

01:43:56.492 --> 01:43:59.093
You're off to a better
place than most then.

01:44:00.440 --> 01:44:01.580
Then you need to be in a place

01:44:01.580 --> 01:44:03.063
where you don't take the money.

01:44:04.050 --> 01:44:05.750
You get in that place, you'll win.

01:44:06.670 --> 01:44:10.340
That's the right advice and
that's why kids piss me off.

01:44:10.340 --> 01:44:12.500
I do a lot of content for
the kids and they love me.

01:44:12.500 --> 01:44:14.090
But then when I get one on one,

01:44:14.090 --> 01:44:15.811
I'm like, you're a piece of shit.

01:44:15.811 --> 01:44:19.573
You want the money, but don't
wanna listen to your parents.

01:44:20.670 --> 01:44:23.140
They're paying for the right
to tell you what to do.

01:44:23.140 --> 01:44:24.310
Get off the payroll.

01:44:24.310 --> 01:44:25.963
You're such a big shot?

01:44:28.960 --> 01:44:30.730
You can't have both.

01:44:30.730 --> 01:44:32.760
You can't have the fuckin' Mercedes

01:44:32.760 --> 01:44:33.593
and the fuckin' gym membership

01:44:33.593 --> 01:44:36.130
that your parents are paying for;

01:44:36.130 --> 01:44:37.780
but then do it exactly how you want,

01:44:37.780 --> 01:44:40.013
spitting in their face
against what they want.

01:44:41.630 --> 01:44:42.640
Right?

01:44:42.640 --> 01:44:44.890
So either you're your
own person or you're not.

01:44:44.890 --> 01:44:46.270
It's binary.

01:44:46.270 --> 01:44:47.103
I love when people are like,

01:44:47.103 --> 01:44:48.700
it's so fun for me,
it's just sitting here.

01:44:48.700 --> 01:44:49.950
I don't even wanna leave.

01:44:49.950 --> 01:44:52.400
All these meetings and emails and DMs

01:44:52.400 --> 01:44:54.300
and conversations I have.

01:44:54.300 --> 01:44:55.740
Yo, I'm independent.

01:44:55.740 --> 01:44:57.430
Well, they do pay for the gym.

01:44:57.430 --> 01:44:59.900
And I do have an Amazon stipend

01:44:59.900 --> 01:45:02.121
and Uber is on my dad's credit card.

01:45:02.121 --> 01:45:02.978
I'm like, you're on the payroll.

01:45:02.978 --> 01:45:03.811
(group laughing)

01:45:03.811 --> 01:45:05.313
You're on the fucking payroll.

01:45:06.300 --> 01:45:08.010
Get off the payroll and do
whatever the fuck you want.

01:45:08.010 --> 01:45:11.181
Stay on the payroll and do
whatever the fuck they want.

01:45:11.181 --> 01:45:12.014
- So we're meeting here

01:45:12.014 --> 01:45:13.523
every week now?
- Yeah, this is it.

01:45:13.523 --> 01:45:15.189
This is it.

01:45:15.189 --> 01:45:18.356
(soft rhythmic music)

